{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an atmospheric simulation set in the Medieval Mediterranean. As a master vintner, you will experience every stage of the journey from grape harvesting to wine bottling, striving to create the finest wine with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Medieval Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live an authentic life on the Mediterranean coast, surrounded by your vineyard and humble home.  Detailed visuals and immersive environments will draw you into this timeless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/9d489a2e5704f271c10f202c818f950a.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/9d489a2e5704f271c10f202c818f950a.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/9d489a2e5704f271c10f202c818f950a.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Interactive Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wine production requires attention and skill at every stage. In interactive mini games such as pressing and fermentation, the actions you take influence both the quality of the wine you produce and the overall gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/320edbe957b75c4f3a84e5a89d5fdf27.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/320edbe957b75c4f3a84e5a89d5fdf27.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/320edbe957b75c4f3a84e5a89d5fdf27.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf47 <strong>Grape Harvest and Selection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare the best soil and environment for your vines, harvest at the right time, and carefully select the grapes to achieve the highest quality wine. Every decision you make shapes the flavor and value of your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/3cb1dbc97f1e16dde599c02ff7612e75.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/3cb1dbc97f1e16dde599c02ff7612e75.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/3cb1dbc97f1e16dde599c02ff7612e75.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/d847fe0be87ef89a9011d95e48acd3b6.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/d847fe0be87ef89a9011d95e48acd3b6.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/d847fe0be87ef89a9011d95e48acd3b6.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f <strong>Authentic Winemaking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience each stage of the craft \u2014 pressing, fermentation, barrel aging, and bottling \u2014 through detailed mini-games and interactive tools. Choose between faster production with machines or meticulous results through traditional handwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/0f8e6c3940c980395448b19bd5a96017.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/0f8e6c3940c980395448b19bd5a96017.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/0f8e6c3940c980395448b19bd5a96017.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Care, Repair, and Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain your vineyard, repair structures, and upgrade your equipment. Over time, take on new responsibilities, hone your skills, and rise from a modest vintner to a respected master. Your ultimate goal: to craft the most exquisite and valuable wine with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/e7fac1da43c4f094e4ee37e7271ea59d.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/e7fac1da43c4f094e4ee37e7271ea59d.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/e7fac1da43c4f094e4ee37e7271ea59d.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Dynamic World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living cycle of day and night, along with changing weather conditions, directly influences your production. Making the right moves at the right time will determine the quality of your harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/2d7150246fee6f64f11d349c319c9456.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/2d7150246fee6f64f11d349c319c9456.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/2d7150246fee6f64f11d349c319c9456.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every harvest is a new effort, every bottle a new experience. \ud83c\udf77</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the one to produce the most exquisite and valuable wine?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875670?t=1771846696","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/ea8b9c82ecfebe64cef6b7148d6330b6b3bbb398/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771846696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/adccdabc43807cb4e222f1423c9ae131ee11cdad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771846696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/adccdabc43807cb4e222f1423c9ae131ee11cdad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771846696","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an atmospheric simulation set in the Medieval Mediterranean. As a master vintner, you will experience every stage of the journey from grape harvesting to wine bottling, striving to create the finest wine with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Medieval Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live an authentic life on the Mediterranean coast, surrounded by your vineyard and humble home.  Detailed visuals and immersive environments will draw you into this timeless world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/9d489a2e5704f271c10f202c818f950a.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/9d489a2e5704f271c10f202c818f950a.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/9d489a2e5704f271c10f202c818f950a.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Interactive Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wine production requires attention and skill at every stage. In interactive mini games such as pressing and fermentation, the actions you take influence both the quality of the wine you produce and the overall gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/320edbe95