vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/e7fac1da43c4f094e4ee37e7271ea59d.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Dynamic World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living cycle of day and night, along with changing weather conditions, directly influences your production. Making the right moves at the right time will determine the quality of your harvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/2d7150246fee6f64f11d349c319c9456.poster.avif?t=1771846696\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/2d7150246fee6f64f11d349c319c9456.webm?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/extras/2d7150246fee6f64f11d349c319c9456.mp4?t=1771846696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every harvest is a new effort, every bottle a new experience. \ud83c\udf77</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the one to produce the most exquisite and valuable wine?</p>","developers":["Nomad Realms Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875670/39bca0d1ac019d16b721ead24d20524773690275/header.jpg?t=1771846696","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></u